#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/_own_notices.html:73
#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:46
msgid "<b>Save the secret key in a safe place.</b> <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span> in the <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> file encrypts the file names kept in the audit and signs the portal sessions. A backup without encryption does not contain it: if the server breaks and you restore the backup with a new key, the names stay unreadable (<span class=\"mono\">[encrypted]</span>) for good. Copy the line from <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> into a password manager, or make encrypted backups (they include <span class=\"mono\">.env</span>)."
msgstr "<b>请把密钥保存在安全的地方。</b><span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 文件中的 <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span> 用于加密审计中保存的文件名并签名门户会话。未加密的备份不包含它：如果服务器损坏而你用新密钥恢复备份，文件名将永远无法读取（<span class=\"mono\">[encrypted]</span>）。请把 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 中的这一行复制到密码管理器，或使用加密备份（其中包含 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span>）。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/_own_notices.html:75
#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:48
msgid "<b>Save the secret key in a safe place.</b> <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span> in the <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> file signs the portal sessions and proves to the gateway who the network announcer is. Whoever knows it can forge a login session, so keep it private. If it is lost, everybody has to sign in again and the network announcement stays off until a new key is set. A backup without encryption does not contain it: copy the line from <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> into a password manager, or make encrypted backups (they include <span class=\"mono\">.env</span>)."
msgstr "<b>请把密钥保存在安全的地方。</b><span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 文件中的 <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span> 用于签名门户会话，并向网关证明网络公告程序的身份。知道它的人可以伪造登录会话，因此请妥善保密。如果丢失，所有人都需要重新登录，网络公告将保持关闭，直到设置新的密钥。未加密的备份不包含它：请将 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 中的这一行复制到密码管理器，或使用加密备份（其中包含 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span>）。"

