msgstr "已有一个更新在等待 updater 处理。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/backups.html:49
msgid "The updater container is running. It controls Docker, which is the same as full control (root) of this server. If you do not need updates from the portal, stop it with “docker compose stop updater”."
msgstr "updater 容器正在运行。它控制 Docker，等同于完全控制（root）这台服务器。如果您不需要在门户内更新，请用“docker compose stop updater”停止它。"

