#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:7
msgid "For you"
msgstr "给您"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:8
msgid "What concerns your own account: print keys, group, quota, requests."
msgstr "与您自己账户有关的事项：打印密钥、组、配额、申请。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:14
#, python-format
msgid "Things the gateway noticed that administrators should know about. The same notice from the same source is reported again only after a while (now: every %(when)s), and repeats in between are counted."
msgstr "网关注意到、管理员应当知道的事项。来自同一来源的同一通知只会隔一段时间再报告一次(现在:每 %(when)s),期间的重复会被计数。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:17
#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:20
msgid "Last time"
msgstr "最近一次"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:17
#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:58
msgid "Times"
msgstr "次数"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:20
#, python-format
msgid "first: %(t)s"
msgstr "首次:%(t)s"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:23
#, python-format
msgid "A scan request without a user name and password from <span class=\"mono\">%(ip)s</span> was refused, because scans without login are off. If your scan app can not send credentials, set <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_ESCL_ANONYMOUS=true</span> in <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> and run <span class=\"mono\">docker compose up -d</span>."
msgstr "来自 <span class=\"mono\">%(ip)s</span> 的无用户名和密码的扫描请求已被拒绝,因为免登录扫描处于关闭状态。如果您的扫描应用无法发送凭据,请在 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 中设置 <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_ESCL_ANONYMOUS=true</span> 并运行 <span class=\"mono\">docker compose up -d</span>。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:25
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Backup not done: the destination folder can not be reached.</b> The latest backup of “%(name)s” was not saved, because the network disk or USB disk does not seem to be connected. Nothing was written. Check that it is switched on and mounted, then press “Run now”. Last successful backup: %(last)s."
msgstr "<b>备份未完成：无法访问目标文件夹。</b>“%(name)s”的最新备份没有保存，因为网络磁盘或 USB 磁盘似乎没有连接。没有写入任何文件。请检查它是否已开机并已挂载，然后点击“立即运行”。上次成功的备份：%(last)s。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:27
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Backup failed.</b> The latest backup of “%(name)s” was not saved. Reason: %(error)s. Last successful backup: %(last)s."
msgstr "<b>备份失败。</b>“%(name)s”的最新备份没有保存。原因：%(error)s。上次成功的备份：%(last)s。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:29
#, python-format
msgid "<b>The certificate could not be updated.</b> The last run of <span class=\"mono\">scripts/cert-sync.sh</span> (%(when)s) failed: %(message)s. The certificate in use is the old one. Run the script by hand to see the error, and check the cron job."
msgstr "<b>无法更新证书。</b><span class=\"mono\">scripts/cert-sync.sh</span> 最近一次运行（%(when)s）失败：%(message)s。当前使用的仍是旧证书。请手动运行脚本查看错误，并检查 cron 任务。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:31
#, python-format
msgid "<b>The TLS certificate has expired</b> (on %(date)s). Phones and computers refuse to connect to the gateway until a valid one is in <span class=\"mono\">config/tls</span> and the gateway has been restarted."
msgstr "<b>TLS 证书已过期</b>（%(date)s）。在 <span class=\"mono\">config/tls</span> 中放入有效证书并重启网关之前，手机和电脑将拒绝连接网关。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:33
#, python-format
msgid "<b>The TLS certificate expires on %(date)s.</b> The last synchronisation worked, so the source has not renewed it yet: check the program that renews it (for example Nginx Proxy Manager)."
msgstr "<b>TLS 证书将于 %(date)s 到期。</b>上次同步成功，说明来源尚未续期：请检查负责续期的程序（例如 Nginx Proxy Manager）。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:34
#, python-format
msgid "<b>The TLS certificate expires on %(date)s.</b> The last synchronisation failed: see the other notice about the certificate."
msgstr "<b>TLS 证书将于 %(date)s 到期。</b>上次同步失败：请查看另一条关于证书的通知。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:35
#, python-format
msgid "<b>The TLS certificate expires on %(date)s.</b> Renew it and put the new files in <span class=\"mono\">config/tls</span>, then restart the gateway."
msgstr "<b>TLS 证书将于 %(date)s 到期。</b>请续期，把新文件放进 <span class=\"mono\">config/tls</span>，然后重启网关。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:37
#, python-format
msgid "<b>The announced address is not in the TLS certificate.</b> The gateway announces itself on the network as <span class=\"mono\">%(names)s</span> at <span class=\"mono\">%(addresses)s</span>, and the certificate covers none of them: phones and computers that find the printers this way will show a certificate error. Make the certificate list the address (or give the machine a fixed address and a name that the certificate covers)."
msgstr "<b>公告的地址不在 TLS 证书中。</b>网关在网络上以 <span class=\"mono\">%(names)s</span> 公告自己，地址为 <span class=\"mono\">%(addresses)s</span>，而证书没有涵盖其中任何一个：以这种方式找到打印机的手机和电脑会显示证书错误。请让证书包含该地址（或给机器设置固定地址和证书涵盖的名称）。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:39
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Paper jam</b> on the printer “%(printer)s”. Jobs wait until somebody clears it."
msgstr "打印机“%(printer)s”<b>卡纸</b>。在有人清除之前，作业会一直等待。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:40
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Out of paper</b> (or empty tray) on the printer “%(printer)s”. Jobs wait until paper is loaded."
msgstr "打印机“%(printer)s”<b>缺纸</b>（或纸盒为空）。装入纸张之前，作业会一直等待。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:41
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Ink or toner is out</b> on the printer “%(printer)s”: %(what)s."
msgstr "打印机“%(printer)s”<b>墨水或墨粉已用完</b>：%(what)s。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:42
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Ink or toner is running low</b> on the printer “%(printer)s”: %(what)s."
msgstr "打印机“%(printer)s”<b>墨水或墨粉不足</b>：%(what)s。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:43
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Problem</b> on the printer “%(printer)s”: %(what)s."
msgstr "打印机“%(printer)s”<b>出现问题</b>：%(what)s。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:51
#, python-format
msgid "<b>The secret key has changed</b> since the previous start (<span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span> in <span class=\"mono\">.env</span>). %(count)s file names in the audit were encrypted with the old key and now show as <span class=\"mono\">[encrypted]</span>. If the change was not wanted (for example a restore with a new <span class=\"mono\">.env</span>), put the old key back and restart: the names become readable again."
msgstr "<b>密钥自上次启动以来已更改</b>（<span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 中的 <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span>）。审计中有 %(count)s 个文件名是用旧密钥加密的，现在显示为 <span class=\"mono\">[encrypted]</span>。如果这不是有意的更改（例如用新的 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 进行了恢复），请恢复旧密钥并重启：文件名将重新可读。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:53
#, python-format
msgid "<b>No secret key is set.</b> <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span> is missing from <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> or set to <span class=\"mono\">none</span>: everybody has to sign in again after every restart and the printers are not announced on the network (mDNS). Write a random value (the output of <span class=\"mono\">openssl rand -hex 32</span>) after <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY=</span> in <span class=\"mono\">.env</span>, run <span class=\"mono\">docker compose up -d</span> and save the key in a safe place. <a href=\"%(url)s\">Step by step</a>."
msgstr "<b>未设置密钥。</b><span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 中缺少 <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY</span>，或其值为 <span class=\"mono\">none</span>：每次重启后所有人都必须重新登录，并且打印机不会在网络上被公布（mDNS）。在 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 中的 <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_SECRET_KEY=</span> 后面写入一个随机值（<span class=\"mono\">openssl rand -hex 32</span> 的输出），运行 <span class=\"mono\">docker compose up -d</span>，并将密钥保存在安全的地方。<a href=\"%(url)s\">分步说明</a>。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:55
#, python-format
msgid "<b>Scans without login are refused: the guest name is already taken.</b> A scan app sent no user name and password, and the account “%(name)s” that would receive its scans already exists as a real account (with a password, from RADIUS, or an administrator), so it is not used. Set a name nobody uses in <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_ESCL_GUEST_USERNAME</span> in <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> and restart the portal."
msgstr "<b>无需登录的扫描被拒绝：访客名称已被占用。</b>某个扫描应用没有发送用户名和密码，而本应接收其扫描的账户“%(name)s”已作为真实账户存在（有密码、来自 RADIUS 或为管理员），因此不会使用它。请在 <span class=\"mono\">.env</span> 文件的 <span class=\"mono\">SPOOLSTEWARD_ESCL_GUEST_USERNAME</span> 中设置一个无人使用的名称，然后重启门户。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/notices.html:59
#, python-format
msgid "dismissed by %(who)s"
msgstr "由 %(who)s 忽略"

