#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:45
msgid "Computers and phones where the printer was set up by hand with the old address will stop printing until they are set up again. Block, maintenance print and the places in the lists follow the queue; the audit keeps the old name for what already happened."
msgstr "使用旧地址手动配置过该打印机的电脑和手机将无法打印，直到重新配置。禁用、维护打印以及在列表中的位置会跟随队列；审计记录对已发生的事件保留旧名称。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:48
#, python-format
msgid "Rename %(printer)s? Computers and phones where it was set up by hand with the old address will stop printing until they are set up again."
msgstr "重命名 %(printer)s？使用旧地址手动配置过它的电脑和手机将无法打印，直到重新配置。"

