#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:74
msgid "A new printer that takes the name of a removed one prints again for the computers and phones set up with the old address, and the permissions given to that name apply to it again. A computer set up with the driver of the old model may need to be set up again if the new model is different."
msgstr "新打印机沿用已移除打印机的名称后，按旧地址设置的电脑和手机就能再次打印，赋予该名称的权限也会重新生效。如果新机型不同，按旧机型驱动设置的电脑可能需要重新设置。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:79
#, python-format
msgid "Periodic print active: %(every)s, %(mode)s"
msgstr "定期打印已启用：%(every)s，%(mode)s"

