msgstr "已关闭：点击开启"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:93
#, python-format
msgid "A printer left idle for a long time dries its ink or sticks its rollers. With the periodic print the gateway sends <b class=\"mono\">%(printer)s</b> a maintenance page at regular intervals. It applies to all administrators."
msgstr "打印机长时间闲置会导致墨水变干或进纸辊粘连。启用定期打印后，网关会按固定间隔向 <b class=\"mono\">%(printer)s</b> 发送一页维护页。该设置对所有管理员生效。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:97
