msgstr "天"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:100
msgid "hours"
msgstr "小时"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:106
msgid "Print in colour (uses a little of every ink: keeps the colour heads working too)"
msgstr "彩色打印（会消耗少量各色墨水：同时保持彩色打印头正常工作）"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:107
msgid "This printer does not print in colour: the page will be black and white."
msgstr "这台打印机不支持彩色打印：该页将为黑白。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:108
msgid "Between 1 hour and 90 days. “Save” records the settings without turning the program on or off: the switch at the top decides that."
msgstr "范围为 1 小时到 90 天。“保存”只会记录参数，不会启用或停用该计划：这由顶部的开关决定。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:109
