msgstr "最近打印的页面：%(when)s。"

#: spoolsteward/admin/templates/printers.html:115
msgid "Prints a page with all the statistics you see here: state, ink, counters, data from the gateway and device details."
msgstr "打印一页，包含您在此处看到的所有统计信息：状态、墨水、计数器、网关数据和设备详情。"

